{
 "character": "DeepSeek, battle outfit (4-battle), T-pose",
 "units": "body GLB units, floor at y = 0 (boot soles), character faces +Z, her left is +X",
 "compose": "world = translate(position) * rotateX(tiltX) * scale(scale) * rotateYXZ(rotYXZ) * (mirrorX ? scale(-1, 1, 1) : 1) * rotateY(yaw) * the GLB scene as exported by Tripo; angles in degrees",
 "clip": "mask rules: hide the surface outside each half-space, e.g. [\"y>\", 0.48] keeps y > 0.48; they stop the body poking through the gloves, stockings and boots",
 "mat": "material changes on top of the Tripo PBR material, in three.js MeshStandardMaterial terms: color multiplies the base colour texture (linear), metalness/roughness replace the metallic-roughness texture, emissive is a colour times the base colour texture, env scales the environment reflections (envMapIntensity)",
 "decal": "face decals (eyes, brows, mouth, blush) are projected onto the head: a box of `size` (width, height, depth) centred at `centre`, turned `yaw` degrees about Y from facing +Z, maps the image onto the head surface inside it; the images were cut from deepseek/base/eyes.png and face.png, see face-decals/decals.json",
 "files": "the full Tripo GLBs named here (Downloads), see README 转 3D; the renders used the full GLBs for head, hair and apron and decimated copies with the same coordinates for the rest",
